☁️ AWS QUESTIONS
❓S3 kya hai?

Answer:
Object storage service hai jo files store karne ke liye use hoti hai.

❓DynamoDB kyun use kiya?

Answer:
Fast NoSQL database hai metadata store karne ke liye:

email
filename
upload time
S3 path
❓IAM Role kyun use kiya?

Answer:
Security ke liye. Access keys code me hardcode nahi ki.

❓Bucket public kyun nahi kiya?

Answer:
Security purpose ke liye. Student files private rehni chahiye.

❓Versioning kyun enable ki?

Answer:
Accidental overwrite/delete se recovery possible hoti hai.

